OL,3,GNEWSAFights, abuse and drugs: bus
OL,4,Aveteran doubts new fines plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter 41 years driving buses, Pete
OL,7,FGibson says he has seen just about
OL,8,Feverything. Fights, drug use, abuse and
OL,9,Feven having a knife pulled on him are
OL,10,Famong the incidents he recalls from
OL,11,Fmore than four decades behind the
OL,12,Fwheel.
OL,14,FSo when the government announced plans
OL,15,Fto fine passengers up to #100 for
OL,16,Fantisocial behaviour on buses in
OL,17,FEngland, the veteran driver was
OL,18,Fsceptical.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
